--- errors: JavaScript exception in Rexx
code / errortext                         98.900 / Execution error.
message                                  JavaScript error: TypeError: bad thing.
additional items / [2] class             3 / JSObject:TypeError
additional[2]~name / ~message            TypeError / bad thing
additional[3] (the stack), first line    TypeError: bad thing
throw 42: message / additional[2]        JavaScript error: 42. / '42' (len 2)
throw 42: additional items               2
--- errors: Rexx condition in JavaScript
SYNTAX 41.1 (instanceof RexxError | Erro
    true | true | RexxError | "Error 41.1: Bad arithmetic conversion. (Nonnumeric value (\"a\") used in arithmetic operation.)" | ["message","name","condition","code","rc","errorText","program","line","traceback"] | ["SYNTAX","41.1",41,"Bad arithmetic conversion.","string",224,3,false]
RAISE SYNTAX 93.900 with a message      
    true | true | RexxError | "Error 93.900: Incorrect call to method. (my message.)" | ["message","name","condition","code","rc","errorText","program","line","traceback"] | ["SYNTAX","93.900",93,"Incorrect call to method.","string",226,3,false]
user condition (RAISE USER oops)        
    no error
--- errors: JavaScript exception through Rexx and back
